  "example_summary": "Calculating the taxable income for T Ltd., a tea manufacturing company, by applying Section 33AB deductions, Rule 8 agricultural splits, and Section 72 loss set-offs.",
  "source_provision": "| Provision | Description | Condition/Formula |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Section 33AB | Tea Development Account | Deposit with NABARD (Lower of actual or 40% of PGBP) |\n| Rule 8 | Tea Manufacturing | 60% treated as Agricultural Income (Exempt) |\n| Section 72 | Set-off of Loss | Carry forward business loss set-off against business profit |\n\n> [!IMPORTANT] Order of Computation\n> Deduction under Section 33AB must be computed on PGBP before applying Rule 8 and before set-off of carried forward business losses.\n\n> [!WARNING] Statutory Trap\n> Agricultural income (60%) is excluded from the taxable base. The loss under Section 72 can only be set-off against the remaining business income (40%).",
